{"id":"2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion","date":"2026-10-18","topic":"sports","region":"europe","headline":"Billy Loughnane Wins Champion Jockey Title at Ascot","source":{"name":"BBC Sport","url":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/horse-racing/articles/cv98zwz4y2w4o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss"},"accent":"us","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"Billy Loughnane collected his champion jockey trophy on Saturday.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t1-0.m4a","dur":4.22,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":4.93,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.98,1.42,1.82,2.32,2.9,3.16,3.52]},{"text":"He was the youngest to win since 1923.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t1-1.m4a","dur":3.11,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":4.83,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.18,0.34,0.64,0.96,1.18,1.58]},{"text":"He won more than 220 total races this year.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t1-2.m4a","dur":3.32,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":4.24,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.22,0.48,0.66,1.38,2.16,2.52,2.88]},{"text":"He loved his job and worked with his dad.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t1-3.m4a","dur":2.25,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":4.56,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.3,0.52,0.88,1.32,1.5,1.68,1.8]},{"text":"The young man wants to win again next year.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t1-4.m4a","dur":2.96,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":3.8,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.2,0.4,0.8,1.02,1.22,1.52,1.98]}],"bands":{"core1000":85,"core1800":5,"ngsl":2,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":8}},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"Billy Loughnane received a special prize at Ascot on Saturday.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t2-0.m4a","dur":4.24,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":5.43,"times":[0.0,0.38,1.04,1.36,1.76,2.14,2.58,2.98,3.42,3.64]},{"text":"The twenty-year-old Irishman became the youngest leader since 1923.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t2-1.m4a","dur":4.87,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":6.07,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.78,1.38,1.74,1.98,2.26,2.76,3.22]},{"text":"He finished ahead of Oisin Murphy after winning over 220 races.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t2-2.m4a","dur":4.73,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":6.14,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.34,0.8,0.98,1.32,1.58,2.2,2.42,2.82,3.3]},{"text":"He loved his job because he always wanted to ride.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t2-3.m4a","dur":3.01,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":4.91,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.32,0.6,0.9,1.38,1.52,1.92,2.32,2.56]},{"text":"Loughnane will try to break a famous record next year.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t2-4.m4a","dur":2.86,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":4.58,"times":[0.0,0.44,0.6,0.8,0.94,1.12,1.34,1.66,2.18,2.46]},{"text":"Another rider named William Buick also finished first in multiple races.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t2-5.m4a","dur":5.06,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":5.28,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.52,0.94,1.36,1.84,2.34,2.76,3.14,3.46,3.78]}],"bands":{"core1000":84,"core1800":6,"ngsl":2,"tsl":2,"nawl":0,"beyond":6}},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"Billy Loughnane received his trophy at Ascot on Saturday as Britain's champion jockey.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t3-0.m4a","dur":5.7,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":7.44,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.9,1.18,1.56,1.84,2.26,2.8,3.12,3.48,4.06,4.58,4.98]},{"text":"He has become the youngest rider who won the title since Charlie Elliott in 1923.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t3-1.m4a","dur":5.52,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":7.21,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.16,0.38,0.64,0.96,1.38,1.76,1.96,2.12,2.36,2.74,3.12,3.68,4.06]},{"text":"Loughnane finished ahead of five-time champion Oisin Murphy after winning over 220 races.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t3-2.m4a","dur":6.42,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":7.13,"times":[0.0,0.34,0.64,0.98,1.15,1.72,2.22,2.74,3.04,3.78,4.04,4.42,4.84]},{"text":"The young Irish rider earned several major victories this year with his favorite horse.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t3-3.m4a","dur":4.55,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":6.19,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.2,0.48,0.78,1.16,1.58,2.02,2.44,2.84,3.1,3.34,3.48,3.9]},{"text":"He plans to celebrate his career success with a quiet meal alongside his parents.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t3-4.m4a","dur":4.34,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":6.57,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.24,0.44,0.74,1.06,1.32,1.68,2.08,2.16,2.48,2.84,3.34,3.72]},{"text":"Looking ahead, Loughnane will target the historic calendar record set by Sir Gordon Richards.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t3-5.m4a","dur":5.79,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":7.54,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.9,1.26,1.42,1.72,1.94,2.4,2.88,3.52,3.92,4.14,4.32,4.6]}],"bands":{"core1000":74,"core1800":9,"ngsl":6,"tsl":4,"nawl":0,"beyond":7}},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"Billy Loughnane was crowned Britain's champion jockey at Ascot on Saturday after a remarkable season.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t4-0.m4a","dur":6.51,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":8.72,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.94,1.2,1.58,2.26,2.72,3.2,3.48,3.96,4.18,4.52,5.12,5.32,5.94]},{"text":"At 20 years old, the Irish jockey became the youngest titleholder since Charlie Elliott achieved the feat in 1923.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t4-1.m4a","dur":7.36,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":10.35,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.4,0.74,1.36,1.42,1.7,2.14,2.46,2.68,3.02,3.8,4.08,4.48,5.12,5.44,5.7,5.9,6.16]},{"text":"Loughnane secured more than 220 victories this year, finishing ahead of five-time champion Oisin Murphy.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t4-2.m4a","dur":6.77,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":8.1,"times":[0.0,0.44,0.78,1.12,1.3,1.76,2.84,3.24,3.78,4.0,4.36,4.57,5.26,5.72,6.24]},{"text":"His notable achievements included winning his first Classic in May on a horse named Bow Echo.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t4-3.m4a","dur":5.14,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":8.2,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.53,1.1,1.49,1.84,2.02,2.28,2.78,3.16,3.4,3.72,3.8,3.98,4.22,4.58]},{"text":"Murphy praised the young jockey, stating that Loughnane possessed outstanding discipline and an exceptional work ethic.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t4-4.m4a","dur":6.14,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":7.87,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.62,0.88,1.02,1.66,1.9,2.12,2.64,2.84,3.68,4.34,4.76,4.86,5.3,5.74]},{"text":"Rather than celebrating at wild parties, Loughnane stated that he planned to enjoy a celebratory meal.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t4-5.m4a","dur":5.43,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":5.79,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.38,0.86,1.14,1.34,2.36,2.74,3.0,3.26,3.36,3.62,3.82,4.12,4.32,5.02]},{"text":"The ambitious young rider now aims to challenge Sir Gordon Richards' long-standing record of 269 annual wins.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t4-6.m4a","dur":7.25,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":9.48,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.3,0.68,0.98,1.42,1.68,1.92,2.22,2.5,2.82,3.33,4.04,4.46,4.72,5.78,6.58]},{"text":"On the same day, British-Norwegian jockey William Buick celebrated three notable victories at the Ascot course.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t4-7.m4a","dur":6.54,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t4-7.m4a","durJa":8.16,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.14,0.32,0.6,1.6,2.08,2.46,3.04,3.38,4.04,4.48,4.94,5.2,5.3,5.64]}],"bands":{"core1000":66,"core1800":8,"ngsl":7,"tsl":5,"nawl":0,"beyond":14}},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"Irish rider Billy Loughnane was officially crowned Britain's champion jockey at Ascot on Saturday following a spectacular campaign.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t5-0.m4a","dur":8.28,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":10.78,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.8,1.1,1.76,2.06,2.52,2.98,3.58,4.08,4.56,4.74,5.22,5.44,5.86,6.5,6.78,7.3]},{"text":"At just 20 years of age, he is the youngest jockey to claim the prestigious title since Charlie Elliott back in 1923.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t5-1.m4a","dur":7.76,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":8.86,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.28,0.7,0.96,1.18,1.7,1.84,1.98,2.12,2.54,2.96,3.16,3.42,3.58,3.92,4.5,4.84,5.28,5.82,6.18,6.36]},{"text":"Loughnane surpassed five-time champion Oisin Murphy, racking up more than 220 wins throughout a dominant calendar year.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t5-2.m4a","dur":7.41,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":8.49,"times":[0.0,0.42,1.03,1.64,2.08,2.54,3.5,3.7,3.84,4.04,4.18,4.54,5.54,5.9,6.12,6.52,6.92]},{"text":"Four years after making his professional debut, the young jockey secured his first Classic victory in May aboard Bow Echo.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t5-3.m4a","dur":7.09,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":8.09,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.44,0.66,0.98,1.2,1.56,2.66,2.68,2.88,3.26,3.64,3.86,4.22,4.64,5.2,5.44,5.7,6.2,6.52]},{"text":"Defeated rival Murphy paid warm tribute to Loughnane, praising his incredible discipline, relentless work ethic, and outstanding riding performance.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t5-4.m4a","dur":8.57,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":12.34,"times":[0.0,0.44,0.64,0.96,1.46,1.82,2.14,2.48,3.2,3.44,3.72,4.26,5.28,5.6,6.14,6.7,6.74,7.02,7.78]},{"text":"Known for his modest lifestyle, Loughnane opted to mark the landmark occasion with a simple meal alongside his parents.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t5-5.m4a","dur":6.4,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":8.51,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.36,0.5,0.82,1.98,2.26,2.48,2.78,2.96,3.16,3.44,3.96,4.28,4.38,4.7,5.06,5.46,5.82]},{"text":"Looking to the future, the talented young Irishman has already set his sights on breaking Sir Gordon Richards' 1947 record.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t5-6.m4a","dur":7.1,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t5-6.m4a","durJa":9.93,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.34,0.42,1.1,1.2,1.54,1.88,2.4,2.58,3.02,3.34,3.48,3.7,3.96,4.24,4.6,4.88,5.48,6.46]},{"text":"Meanwhile, British-Norwegian jockey William Buick enjoyed an extraordinary afternoon at Ascot by riding three separate horses to victory.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/t5-7.m4a","dur":8.23,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-sports-billy-loughnane-wins-champion/ja/t5-7.m4a","durJa":10.65,"times":[0.0,0.55,1.46,1.9,2.2,2.7,2.98,3.28,3.86,4.42,4.76,5.12,5.52,5.76,6.14,6.64,6.92,7.22]}],"bands":{"core1000":60,"core1800":10,"ngsl":7,"tsl":8,"nawl":2,"beyond":13}}},"glossary":[{"word":"prize","lemma":"prize","pos":"noun","ipa":"/praɪz/","definition":"an award given to a winner of a contest","tiers":["t2"]},{"word":"trophy","lemma":"trophy","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈtroʊfi/","definition":"a decorative object given as a prize for winning","tiers":["t3"]},{"word":"victories","lemma":"victory","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈvɪktəriz/","definition":"instances of winning a competition or race","tiers":["t3","t4"]},{"word":"crowned","lemma":"crown","pos":"verb","ipa":"/kraʊnd/","definition":"declared as the official winner of a championship","tiers":["t4","t5"]},{"word":"discipline","lemma":"discipline","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈdɪsəplən/","definition":"the ability to control oneself and work hard consistently","tiers":["t4","t5"]},{"word":"work ethic","lemma":"work ethic","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈwɜrk ˌɛθɪk/","definition":"a personal belief in the value of hard work","tiers":["t4","t5"]},{"word":"prestigious","lemma":"prestigious","pos":"adjective","ipa":"/prɛˈstɪdʒəs/","definition":"inspiring respect and admiration as very important","tiers":["t5"]},{"word":"debut","lemma":"debut","pos":"noun","ipa":"/deɪˈbju/","definition":"a first public appearance in a role or career","tiers":["t5"]}],"narrator":"Fenrir"}